  <!--EN: Cover the death pit with twisted metal slags to prevent anything from crawling out.-->
  <VQED_FillPitDesc>用扭曲的金属渣盖住死亡坑，防止任何东西爬出来。</VQED_FillPitDesc>
  <!--EN: To protect the launch site, General {0} has reactivated the military turrets throughout the complex.-->
  <VQED_GeneralActivatedTurrets>为了保护发射场，{0} 将军已重新启动整个综合体的 军事 炮塔。</VQED_GeneralActivatedTurrets>
  <!--EN: To protect the launch site, General {0} has awakened a number of high ranking officers from their slumber.-->
  <VQED_GeneralAwakenedOfficers>为了保护发射场，{0} 将军将一些高级军官从沉睡中唤醒。</VQED_GeneralAwakenedOfficers>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_nameFull} awakens-->
  <VQED_GeneralAwakensLabel>{PAWN_nameFull}苏醒</VQED_GeneralAwakensLabel>
  <!--EN: The sealed sarcophagus hisses open, releasing a cloud of deadlife dust, and from within rises {PAWN_title} {PAWN_nameFull}.

Once the commander of Operation: Deadlife, {PAWN_nameFull} is now a shambler-bound remnant of a forgotten war. As {PAWN_pronoun} awakens, {PAWN_pronoun} begin reactivating the base’s long-dormant defense systems: rotstink vents, turret grids, shambler kennels, and containment pits filled with the dead.

{PAWN_possessive} ultimate goal is clear: to initiate the launch sequence for the Deadlife ICBMs: orbital warheads designed to blanket the planet in death. If launched, shambler hordes will rise across the world, destroying settlements and ambushing caravans.

You must reach the command center and destroy the ICBM Launch Terminal before {PAWN_nameFull} completes {PAWN_possessive} grim task.-->
  <VQED_GeneralAwakensText>密封的石棺发出嘶嘶声打开，释放出一团死者灰尘，并从内部升起{PAWN_title}{PAWN_nameFull}。

曾经是“死者行动”的指挥官，{PAWN_nameFull}现在是一场被遗忘的战争的摇摇欲坠的-束缚残余。随着{PAWN_pronoun}苏醒，{PAWN_pronoun}开始重新激活基地长期休眠的防御系统：腐臭通风口、炮塔网格、摇摇晃晃的狗舍和装满死者的收容坑。

{PAWN_possessive}最终目标很明确：启动死亡洲际弹道导弹的发射序列：轨道旨在使地球陷入死亡的弹头。一旦发射，漫游者部落将在世界各地崛起，摧毁定居点并伏击商队。

你必须在{PAWN_nameFull}完成{PAWN_possessive}艰巨任务之前到达指挥中心并摧毁洲际弹道导弹发射终端。</VQED_GeneralAwakensText>
