  <!--EN: To protect the launch site, General {0} reactivated the deadlife vents in an attempt to respawn any defeated shamblers.-->
  <VQED_GeneralReactivatedDeadlifeVents>为了保护发射场，{0} 将军重新启动了死亡通风口，试图重生任何被击败的蹒跚者。</VQED_GeneralReactivatedDeadlifeVents>
